// THE THREE BLUDGEON PIECES (skill_slayer/scripts/abyssal_bludgeon.rs2).
//
// Old School's pieces come out of an unsired at the Font of Consumption and take about 619
// Abyssal Sire kills for a full set. There is no Sire here and the owner asked for the abyssal
// demons, which are a slayer task rather than a boss - so the rate is this build's own: three
// rolls of one in fifteen hundred, which is a long task list for the hardest-hitting crush
// weapon in the game.
^bludgeon_piece_rate = 1500
// All three bits set: 1 spine | 2 claw | 4 axon.
^bludgeon_all_pieces = 7
